{"id":"n71473-1-7","stage":3,"title":"코너 · 拐角","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71473-1-7-1","ko":"시청에 가려고 하는데 어떻게 가면 되나요?","zh":"我打算去市政府，要怎么走呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시청에","meaning":"市政府，市厅","explanation":"시청：市政府，市厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65312","senseId":"1","lemma":"시청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가려고","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가면","meaning":"产生，造成","explanation":"가다：产生，造成；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"20","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d089c9bf766d3808","term":"시청","zh":"市政府，市厅","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3","entryId":"65312","definition":"负责市行政事务的机关。","pronunciation":["시ː청"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上；产生，造成","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d0905ddbdd4c037cf0ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71473-1-7-2","ko":"저 앞 코너를 돌면 바로 시청이에요.","zh":"只要转过前面的那个拐角，就是市政府了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코너를","meaning":"拐角","explanation":"코너：拐角；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"코너","audio":"/audio/59ce278f23b97c67ae84.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71473","senseId":"1","lemma":"코너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌면","meaning":"转，拐","explanation":"돌다：转，拐；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"19","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"바로：就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"7","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시청이에요.","meaning":"市政府，市厅","explanation":"시청：市政府，市厅；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"시청","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65312","senseId":"1","lemma":"시청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"59ce278f23b97c67","term":"코너","zh":"拐角","audio":"/audio/59ce278f23b97c67ae84.mp3","entryId":"71473","definition":"角落或拐弯处。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"转，拐","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"沿着路改变方向。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"就","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"时间上或空间上非常近地。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"d089c9bf766d3808","term":"시청","zh":"市政府，市厅","audio":"/audio/d089c9bf766d3808ef00.mp3","entryId":"65312","definition":"负责市行政事务的机关。","pronunciation":["시ː청"]}],"audio":"/audio/21c0896ecdef96aaf9fc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71473","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":101,"sequenceScore":2.6567,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["只要转过前面的那个拐角，就是市政府了。","我打算去市政府，要怎么走呢？","我们要不要一起拍张照片？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我打算去市政府，要怎么走呢？","我们要不要一起拍张照片？","只要转过前面的那个拐角，就是市政府了。"],"answer":2}]}
